# Site-review widget on the docs site. Both optional: with no project the
# widget is not injected at all, which is the default and what CI-less clones
# get.
#
# Name a project of its own, not the one Loupe's own pages use. Otherwise docs
# feedback lands in the same stream as feedback on the app. The project id is
# on its Connect page, and the project must allow this site's address.
#
# The reviewer signs in through the OAuth popup, so the page source carries no
# credential.
PUBLIC_SITE_REVIEW_PROJECT=
PUBLIC_SITE_REVIEW_HOST=https://loupe.dev.localhost
